  "details": "Currently, only shader texture properties explicitly labelled '_MatCap' (case-sensitive) will automatically fall back. Removing this case-sensitivity will allow far more avatars to fall back automatically, notably those using Poiyomi shaders.\n\nFor the record we are going to get this fixed for Poiyomi shaders at some point going forward, but there's nothing we can do about avatars already out in the wild.",
